  "name": "01 Speed-to-lead: webhook, AI call, CRM tag",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Speed-to-lead\nA new lead lands (CRM workflow or web form) → verify it really came from us → normalize → guards → call them within seconds → tag the CRM contact.\n\nThe webhook answers 200 for skipped leads too. A non-2xx would make the CRM retry and re-send the same lead.",
